    {
      "contentTypeKey": "34e5aa3b-db10-40a1-893d-79e98cd3f2f4",
      "key": "c51c6d7d-1827-4132-8652-01423afed473",
      "values": [
        {
          "alias": "featurePropertyFeatureTitle",
          "culture": null,
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": "Features"
        },
        {
          "alias": "richTextContent",
          "culture": null,
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": {
            "blocks": {
              "contentData": [],
              "settingsData": [],
              "expose": [],
              "layout": {}
            },
            "markup": "\u003Cul\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003E4* hotel\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003EHalf board accommodation\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003EAll excursions \u0026amp; guided tours included\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003EProfessional tour manager\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003EScheduled flights to Italy\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003EExecutive coach in Italy\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003EOne free place per 10 paying passengers\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003C/ul\u003E\n"
          }
        },
        {
          "alias": "featurePropertyFeatureDescription",
          "culture": null,
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": "What\u0027s included in this tour is entirely yours to customise to suit your group\u0027s budget and preferences. Here is what we\u0027ve suggested:"
        },
        {
          "alias": "featurePropertyFeatureSummary",
          "culture": null,
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": ""
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "contentTypeKey": "1d09b5af-b95a-4af5-b8f2-323db029e817",
      "key": "3d196c9f-c0cd-4821-b3cf-1edd9c0be123",
      "values": [
        {
          "alias": "featurePropertyFeatureTitle",
          "culture": null,
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": "Accommodation"
        },
        {
          "alias": "richTextContent",
          "culture": null,
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": {
            "blocks": {
              "contentData": [],
              "settingsData": [],
              "expose": [],
              "layout": {}
            },
            "markup": "\u003Cp\u003EFive nights on half board basis at the 4* Terme Roma Hotel in the charming spa town of Abano Terme near Padova. Facilities at the hotel include a restaurant, bar and an indoor and outdoor swimming pool.\u003C/p\u003E\n"
          }
        },
        {
          "alias": "featurePropertyFeatureDescription",
          "culture": null,
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": "Where you stay is entirely yours to choose to match your group\u0027s preferences. Here is our suggested accommodation:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "contentTypeKey": "2d9b0603-29ef-423a-8d3e-d9c039d3d7b1",
      "key": "17ce1511-a6ad-4e1d-bb2e-562ce923aa66",
      "values": [
        {
          "alias": "featurePropertyFeatureTitle",
          "culture": null,
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": "Sights"
        },
        {
          "alias": "richTextContent",
          "culture": null,
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": {
            "blocks": {
              "contentData": [],
              "settingsData": [],
              "expose": [],
              "layout": {}
            },
            "markup": "\u003Cul\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003EVilla La Rotonda\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003EVicenza - Teatro Olimpico \u0026amp; Basilica Palladiana\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003EPalazzo Leoni Montanari\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003EPadova - guided tour\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003EGiotto\u2019s frescoes at Cappella degli Scrovegni\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003EMantova - Palazzo Ducale \u0026amp; Palazzo Te\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003EVilla La Malcontenta - guided tour\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003EVilla Barbaro at Maser\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003EAsolo\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003ESpa town of Abano Terme\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003C/ul\u003E\n"
          }
        },
        {
          "alias": "featurePropertyFeatureDescription",
          "culture": null,
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": "The places your group visits are exclusively yours to decide. Here are the main sights we\u0027ve suggested:"
        },
        {
          "alias": "featurePropertyFeatureSummary",
          "culture": null,
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": ""
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "contentTypeKey": "de535189-b468-4594-8118-f303bac50e3c",
      "key": "b1a96a5b-22ed-4793-ae7c-a25317b86ae5",
      "values": [
        {
          "alias": "featurePropertyFeatureTitle",
          "culture": null,
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": "Tailor your sights"
        },
        {
          "alias": "richTextContent",
          "culture": null,
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": {
            "blocks": {
              "contentData": [],
              "settingsData": [],
              "expose": [],
              "layout": {}
            },
            "markup": "\u003Cul\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003EVenice - see The Art \u0026amp; Islands of Venice for details\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003EFerrara - one of the region\u2019s greatest walled towns with many attractive streets and medieval houses, a 12th century cathedral and the palaces of the d\u2019Este dynasty\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003EPalazzo dei Diamante, Ferrara - named after the diamond motifs on its fa\u00E7ade, and home to the Pinacoteca Nazionale housing paintings from the Ferrara school from the Middle Ages up to the 18th century\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003EVerona \u0026amp; The Arena - this beautiful Romanesque city and Shakespeare\u2019s inspiration for \u2018Romeo and Juliet\u2019 is home to the Arena dating from 1BC and the ornate Basilica of San Zeno Maggiore\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003C/ul\u003E\n"
          }
        },
        {
          "alias": "featurePropertyFeatureDescription",
          "culture": null,
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": "\nIf you\u0027d prefer to visit different places, or if you\u0027d like to add extra attractions that match your group\u0027s specific interests, here are some more suggestions:"
        },
        {
          "alias": "featurePropertyFeatureSummary",
          "culture": null,
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": ""
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "contentTypeKey": "837beecf-4239-4b3d-b683-1d611af3da2e",
      "key": "0ce34d7c-e486-42dc-8080-fbfc349aec16",
      "values": [
        {
          "alias": "richTextContent",
          "culture": null,
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": {
            "blocks": {
              "contentData": [],
              "settingsData": [],
              "expose": [],
              "layout": {}
            },
            "markup": "\u003Ch3\u003EDay 1 - Abano Terme\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EScheduled flight from your preferred airport to Italy \u2013 transfer with our tour manager in our private executive coach to the 4* Terme Roma Hotel at Abano Terme near Padova.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch3\u003EDay 2 \u2013 Villa La Rotunda, Vicenza \u0026amp; Palazzo Leoni Montanari\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EGuided tour concentrating on the architecture of Andrea Palladio and beginning with a nearby view stop view stop of the domed and porticoed Villa La Rotunda, the most famous of Palladio\u2019s buildings \u2013 continue to the great Palladian city of Vicenza for a tour of a number of his palaces and civic buildings including the Teatro Olimpico, Europe\u2019s oldest surviving indoor theatre designed by Palladio in 1579, and the exterior of the Basilica Palladiana to see one of the first examples of the Palladian window \u2013 the Palazzo Leoni Montanari is home to a wonderful collection of Russian icons and paintings.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch3\u003EDay 3 \u2013 Padova \u0026amp; Cappella degli Scrovegni\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EGuided tour of Padova, one of Italy\u0026#39;s oldest university towns, taking in the Basilica di Sant\u2019Antonio and Donatello\u2019s magnificent reliefs on the miracles of St Anthony, the Caf\u00E9 Pedrocchi, a famous intellectual meeting place dating from 1831, the Piazza delle Erbe and the Jewish Quarter \u2013 pre-paid visit to the Cappella degli Scrovegni to see Giotto\u2019s beautiful frescoes depicting the life of Christ which became a powerful influence on the development of European art \u2013 rest of the day at leisure.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch3\u003EDay 4 \u2013 Mantova - Palazzo Ducale \u0026amp; Palazzo Te\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ETravel to Mantova \u2013 guided tour of the Palazzo Ducale, once one of Europe\u2019s largest palaces and now housing a wonderful art collection including the frescoes in the \u2018Camera degli Sposi\u2019 by Mantegna \u2013 visit to the magnificent Palazzo Te and Giulio Romano\u2019s \u2018Room of Giants\u2019.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch3\u003EDay 5 \u2013 Villa La Malcontenta, Villa Barbaro \u0026amp; Asolo\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EGuided tour of one of Palladio\u2019s loveliest villas, La Malcontenta, beside the Brenta Canal and decorated with magnificent frescoes by Zelotti \u2013 visit Villa Barbaro at Maser designed by Palladio in collaboration with Veronese whose wonderful frescoes adorn the walls \u2013 Asolo is arguably one of the most beautiful hill towns in Italy and a town Robert Browning liked so much he named a volume of poems after it.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch3\u003EDay 6 \u2013 Abano Terme\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EMorning free in Abano Terme with time to relax and shop \u2013 transfer to the airport for our scheduled flight home.\u003C/p\u003E\n"
          }
        },
        {
          "alias": "featurePropertyFeatureTitle",
          "culture": null,
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": "Suggested Itinerary"
        },
        {
          "alias": "featurePropertyFeatureDescription",
          "culture": null,
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": "Your itinerary is exclusively yours to tailor to suit your group\u0027s interests and profile of your members. Here is our suggested itinerary:"
        },
        {
          "alias": "featurePropertyFeatureSummary",
          "culture": null,
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": {
            "blocks": {
              "contentData": [],
              "settingsData": [],
              "expose": [],
              "layout": {}
            },
            "markup": "Remember, every element of this itinerary can be adjusted. If you\u0027d like to change the days, add different activities, or adjust the pace, just let us know."
          }
        }
      ]
    },
